Package: CNA
Type: Package
Title: Co-occurrence Network Analysis
Version: 1.1.0
Author:
  -  Dylan Girault [cre]
  -  Mohammed Saqr [aut]
  -  Santtu Tikka [aut]
  -  Sonsoles López-Pernas [aut]
Maintainer: Sonsoles López-Pernas <sonsoles.lopez@uef.fi>
Description: >-
    Co-occurrence Network Analysis (CNA) of event (long-format), one-hot
    (binary) and delimited (keyword) data, with group comparison and
    clustering. Networks are estimated with the Nestimate package and plotted
    with cograph. Includes centrality and centrality stability, community
    detection, edge betweenness, cliques and the clique complex, backbone
    extraction, link prediction, association rules, bootstrap validation,
    permutation tests, and network and sequence comparison.
